Hi Eman,

Amelia has to estimate many more parameters than the number of variables in
the imputation models, so the number of variables must be (much) lower than
the number of observations. Try marking all but 20-30 variables as "ID" and
running the imputation. In general, you should include any variable that
will be in the subsequent regression model and any that help predict the
missiningness.

Hope that helps!

Cheers,
matt.


